---
// Sección Contacto
---

<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 mb-16 text-center md:text-left">
  <h1
    class="font-titulo font-extrabold text-5xl md:text-7xl text-texto mb-6 tracking-tight leading-tight"
  >
    <span class="text-primario italic">Conectemos</span>
    <br />con la naturaleza.
  </h1>
  <p class="text-texto-suave text-lg max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
    Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Vivamus id condimentum risus, sed
    pharetra mi. Proin auctor, ipsum in commodo bibendum, ipsum mi condimentum dui, eu rutrum orci
    neque et nisi. Aliquam erat volutpat. Nunc convallis condimentum pharetra. Vivamus viverra enim
    in augue laoreet, eu tincidunt neque scelerisque. Mauris lacus felis, lacinia in mollis nec,
    efficitur vitae lectus. Donec at orci condimentum, posuere ligula sit amet, convallis enim.
    Phasellus lacinia bibendum orci, a porttitor libero sollicitudin at. Curabitur malesuada
    sollicitudin arcu, a convallis nibh sodales ac. Nam eget libero sagittis, rhoncus nibh sed,
    tristique ante. Proin sed lectus neque.
  </p>
</section>
<!-- Contact Bento Grid -->
<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
  <!-- Contact Form Card -->
  <div
    class="lg:col-span-7 bg-superficie p-8 md:p-12 rounded-xl shadow-(--shadow-elevada) border border-borde/10"
  >
    <h2 class="font-titulo font-bold text-3xl mb-8">Envianos tu mensaje</h2>
    <form class="space-y-6">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <label class="font-cuerpo text-sm font-semibold text-texto-suave ml-2"
            >Nombre Completo</label
          >
          <input
            class="w-full bg-fondo-alt border-none rounded-lg p-4 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primario/20 focus:bg-superficie transition-all"
            placeholder="Pedro Perez"
            type="text"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <label class="font-cuerpo text-sm font-semibold text-texto-suave ml-2">Email</label>
          <input
            class="w-full bg-fondo-alt border-none rounded-lg p-4 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primario/20 focus:bg-superficie transition-all"
            placeholder="pedro@example.com"
            type="email"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <label class="font-cuerpo text-sm font-semibold text-texto-suave ml-2"
          >Tipo de consulta</label
        >
        <select
          class="w-full bg-fondo-alt border-none rounded-lg p-2 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primario/20 focus:bg-superficie transition-all"
        >
          <option>Información general</option>
          <option>Camping</option>
          <option>Motorhome</option>
          <option>Parque acuático</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <label class="font-cuerpo text-sm font-semibold text-texto-suave ml-2">Mensa</label>
        <textarea
          class="w-full bg-fondo-alt border-none rounded-lg p-4 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primario/20 focus:bg-superficie transition-all"
          placeholder="Como podemos ayudarte?"
          rows="5"></textarea>
      </div>
      <button
        class="w-full md:w-auto bg-gradient-to-r from-primario to-primario-claro text-white px-12 py-4 rounded-full font-bold transition-all hover:shadow-xl active:scale-95"
      >
        Enviar Mensaje
      </button>
    </form>
  </div>
  <!-- Side Info Cluster -->
  <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-8">
    <!-- Quick Contact -->
    <div class="bg-acento/5 p-8 rounded-xl space-y-8">
      <h3 class="font-titulo font-bold text-2xl text-acento">Datos de Contacto</h3>
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="bg-primario/10 p-3 rounded-lg text-primario">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">location_on</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-bold text-texto">Ubicación</p>
            <p class="text-texto-suave">
              Av. de las Cataratas 2000 Ha, Puerto Iguazú, Misiones, Argentina
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="bg-acento/10 p-3 rounded-lg text-acento">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">call</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-bold text-texto">Número de teléfono</p>
            <p class="text-texto-suave">+54 (3757) 31-7593</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="bg-primario/10 p-3 rounded-lg text-primario">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">mail</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-bold text-texto">Email</p>
            <p class="text-texto-suave">tierrarojaiguazu@gmail.com</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a
        class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-[#25D366] text-white w-full py-4 rounded-xl font-bold hover:brightness-110 transition-all shadow-md"
        href="https://wa.me/5493757317593"
      >
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;"
          >chat</span
        >
        Hablar por WhatsApp
      </a>
    </div>
    <!-- Park Image Accent -->
    <div class="relative h-64 rounded-lg overflow-hidden group">
      <img
        alt="Tropical Waterfall"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110"
        data-alt="dramatic wide angle shot of a tropical waterfall cascading into a crystal clear pool surrounded by lush red soil and ferns"
        src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDhJhm3x-dg8QqZXOONwhRhQu_lxdZ965TPmzu7Og6scxXtyDEOmbYxd3wKcU71XQK_p7NhnEQKeWpgasBzJ-9N6jKldc4nsV-izcXr79zawnUEjsAOc-JVaGOLvwAcZ9I1jazAaPJhTvGf8ZJ150hDhrMfmJ7lc0yl2BF-_y5L4aPfAW_Mh30ljTW4BlWU7EEjoZ3LprWEiASlmsO-3HuNWK-OuvsaRbW75rG-0m5iuGI3zbQscHurXG5ktW9OiE8f5OEwkHTgulYd"
      />
      <div
        class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent flex items-end p-6"
      >
        <p class="text-white font-titulo font-bold text-xl">The heart of the rainforest.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<!-- Map Section -->
<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 mt-20">
  <div class="bg-fondo p-4 rounded-xl">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-6 mb-8 px-4 py-6">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-titulo font-extrabold text-3xl">Encuéntranos en el mapa</h2>
        <p class="text-texto-suave">
          Ubicado a tan solo 20 minutos de las majestuosas Cataratas del Iguazú.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <div
          class="bg-fondo-alt px-6 py-3 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold flex items-center gap-2"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primario">schedule</span>
          <b>Para pasar el día:</b> 9:00hs - 19:00hs <br />
          <b>Camping & Motorhome:</b> 24hs.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="w-full h-72 sm:h-96 lg:h-[500px] rounded-lg overflow-hidden bg-fondo-alt relative">
      <!-- Representational Map Image since we cannot use live JS Maps -->
      <img
        class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale"
        data-alt="abstract satellite view map of a river delta meeting dense tropical forest in muted earthy tones with a red location pin"
        data-location="Puerto Iguazú, Argentina"
        src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBgLyVz9Mx69Eqj1wPAYg7GVQuHVSL0heNR0QSp1IQPm9ewD_33L3bqy_gnarkI4OXX-3tszygUdemxKvt_XnfZfDV_T1oYEXu4CIxK83v1D2Aa9EWL4Gp2ghUM-Fd36dN84qgSEG_RUhpJdj_G8zkpGWERxZGO0RZMTyMbnLq14kTnM0scMBvR7f3mDiVHgIo7ldD7yRTFuc7d9Ey-9NW-xQtoYURT4Fy_-2OASuBy10d8qNHdLbg21YYKhMYepp7jTeUpUzunE9IT"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center">
        <div class="bg-superficie p-6 rounded-lg shadow-2xl flex items-center gap-4 animate-pulse">
          <div class="bg-primario p-4 rounded-full text-white">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;"
              >location_on</span
            >
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-titulo font-black text-primario">Tierra Roja Iguazú</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-texto-suave">Entrance Main Gate</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
